  "details": "<p>Lattara was founded on one of the coastal lagoons of Languedoc with access to the Ledus fl. and was a center for trade with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../413122/\">Etruria</a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../148127\">Massalia</a>, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../423025\">Rome</a>. It became uninhabited in the second to third centuries A.D. The site is now surrounded by the modern city of Lattes.</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
